* Version reset for new development line based on redmine_up_tags
* Target: Redmine 7.0.0 / Ruby 3.4 / Rails 8.1
* Compatibility with redmineup Q&A and other RedmineUP tag plugins preserved
* Plugin ID remains :redmineup_tags
